1
00:01:24,250 --> 00:01:29,291
Long, gruelling journeys
began with friendship.

2
00:02:20,666 --> 00:02:21,916
One... Two...

3
00:02:23,166 --> 00:02:24,458
Hey! Move aside!

4
00:02:25,791 --> 00:02:30,083
♪ A man may become a god ♪

5
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:35,125
♪ When he gives freely,
he becomes generous ♪

6
00:02:37,875 --> 00:02:39,583
Kalai! Hey!

7
00:02:40,583 --> 00:02:42,375
-Hold on! I'm coming!
-Come!

8
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:51,291
Quick! The call's gonna get cut!

9
00:03:10,333 --> 00:03:12,083
Subbu is dead.

10
00:03:16,666 --> 00:03:17,708
I killed him.

11
00:03:22,333 --> 00:03:24,625
I have to unload the goods
by tomorrow night.

12
00:03:24,708 --> 00:03:27,125
I'll be at Davanagere Bus Stand
by evening.

13
00:03:28,250 --> 00:03:31,875
If we leave now,
we'll reach by morning.

14
00:03:32,208 --> 00:03:34,500
Karthi saved our
family's honour.

15
00:03:34,666 --> 00:03:37,166
Pay his mother ten grand.
Say it's from him.

16
00:03:37,250 --> 00:03:39,125
Why ten? We'll give her thirty grand!

17
00:03:40,500 --> 00:03:45,083
♪ If the heart wants,
deer can live in a bird’s nest ♪

18
00:03:45,166 --> 00:03:49,416
♪ If there is a way, a mountain can be
seen inside a mustard seed ♪

19
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:54,250
♪ If the heart wants,
deer can live in a bird’s nest ♪

20
00:03:54,333 --> 00:03:58,666
♪ If there is a way, a mountain can be
seen inside a mustard seed ♪

21
00:03:58,750 --> 00:04:02,875
♪ If one dares, the head can bear
the heaviest of burdens ♪

22
00:04:02,958 --> 00:04:08,291
♪ Character… Character…
it can become a temple ♪

23
00:04:08,375 --> 00:04:12,875
♪ A man can become a god ♪

24
00:04:12,958 --> 00:04:17,291
♪ When he gives freely,
he becomes generous ♪

25
00:04:17,375 --> 00:04:21,000
♪ Like the tree that gives all,
he can become a martyr ♪

26
00:04:21,083 --> 00:04:26,291
♪ Like melting wax,
he can spread light ♪

27
00:04:26,375 --> 00:04:30,750
♪ A man can become a god ♪

28
00:04:30,833 --> 00:04:33,291
♪ Can become a god... ♪

29
00:04:42,041 --> 00:04:44,500
Ah!

30
00:05:06,583 --> 00:05:09,416
Why are you scared of blood?

31
00:05:09,500 --> 00:05:12,250
A little coffee powder will fix it.

32
00:05:12,333 --> 00:05:14,291
Come with me, you wuss.

33
00:05:18,958 --> 00:05:22,875
Those guys always show off
to newcomers.

34
00:05:22,958 --> 00:05:25,291
Don't worry. I've got you.

35
00:05:26,041 --> 00:05:27,625
I'm Subbu.

36
00:05:27,833 --> 00:05:29,375
I'm Karthi.

37
00:05:29,958 --> 00:05:33,125
Ma’am, please keep him here
for ten minutes.

38
00:05:33,208 --> 00:05:34,791
You'll be safe here.

39
00:05:36,083 --> 00:05:37,291
Useless buffalos!

40
00:05:37,375 --> 00:05:40,291
Hey! Which one of you
beat up the new kid?

41
00:05:40,458 --> 00:05:41,750
We all did. What about it?

42
00:05:41,916 --> 00:05:43,166
Try that...

43
00:05:43,916 --> 00:05:45,291
...with me.

44
00:06:05,041 --> 00:06:07,250
Why are you guys fighting?
Come with me!

45
00:06:07,791 --> 00:06:08,791
It was them, sir!

46
00:06:08,875 --> 00:06:10,875
They hit the new kid with a slate!

47
00:06:10,958 --> 00:06:13,125
Why are you hitting him! Go!

48
00:06:13,250 --> 00:06:15,250
Come to the Principal's room!

49
00:06:32,666 --> 00:06:35,875
Saw how I went full Bruce Lee on them?

50
00:06:36,083 --> 00:06:39,416
Yeah. Even the older boys fear you.

51
00:06:39,500 --> 00:06:41,166
They should!

52
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:45,125
My dad and brothers
have been to jail.

53
00:06:45,375 --> 00:06:48,958
Dhanam, there are no women in my house.
Come live with me.

54
00:06:49,041 --> 00:06:50,416
Get lost!

55
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,125
Get lost?

56
00:06:54,041 --> 00:06:56,625
Karthi, why are you scared all the time?

57
00:06:56,708 --> 00:06:58,166
Men must be brave.

58
00:06:58,250 --> 00:06:59,750
I'll make you one.

59
00:07:00,208 --> 00:07:02,125
From today, we're friends.

60
00:07:10,208 --> 00:07:11,666
Steel Claw.

61
00:07:12,333 --> 00:07:13,916
Can I buy this, Subbu?

62
00:07:15,833 --> 00:07:18,583
Two cycles for rent and a book.
How much, brother?

63
00:07:18,666 --> 00:07:19,750
Five rupees.

64
00:07:19,833 --> 00:07:22,541
I can buy a new cycle
for five more rupees!

65
00:07:22,625 --> 00:07:23,958
You've got a big mouth, kid.

66
00:07:24,750 --> 00:07:26,625
-I’m first!
-No, I’m first!

67
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:33,791
Subbu, the brakes aren't working!

68
00:07:43,916 --> 00:07:47,916
When we grow up,
we too must kiss a girl like this.

69
00:07:48,375 --> 00:07:49,500
Pay attention.

70
00:07:55,833 --> 00:08:00,916
It’ll be awesome if we too become
Steel Claw!

71
00:08:03,250 --> 00:08:05,541
Why are you flinching like a hen?

72
00:08:05,708 --> 00:08:08,166
We are fighting roosters. Eat like one.

73
00:08:08,541 --> 00:08:12,458
-Karthi, swing it like actor MGR!
-Check this out!

74
00:08:16,458 --> 00:08:18,958
RAMU MILITARY HOTEL

75
00:08:22,416 --> 00:08:24,958
-A plate of lamb chops, brother.
-Lamb chops for the lady!

76
00:08:28,041 --> 00:08:29,041
Hey!

77
00:08:29,125 --> 00:08:31,416
Why are you eating it like a dosa?

78
00:08:38,416 --> 00:08:40,583
This is how you eat a parotta.

79
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,958
Try these lamb chops.

80
00:08:47,041 --> 00:08:49,208
Actor Sivaji Ganesan relished this

81
00:08:49,291 --> 00:08:51,750
when filming in our village. Enjoy!

82
00:08:53,833 --> 00:08:57,708
Look! A photo of Sivaji Ganesan sir!

83
00:08:57,833 --> 00:08:58,750
Oh yes!

84
00:08:58,916 --> 00:09:00,875
How much for the lamb chops, sister?

85
00:09:01,166 --> 00:09:02,208
Hey kid!

86
00:09:02,291 --> 00:09:05,500
When a village feeds you with love,
you don't refuse.

87
00:09:05,750 --> 00:09:07,916
Kindness has no price!

88
00:09:18,750 --> 00:09:21,208
You let your mother starve to death.

89
00:09:21,291 --> 00:09:24,833
Is your crying gonna
bring her back to life?

90
00:09:32,125 --> 00:09:36,666
Hey! Don’t close your eyes.
It's just a corpse.

91
00:09:36,750 --> 00:09:39,041
I've seen dozens.

92
00:09:39,541 --> 00:09:43,000
Even my mom and sister died right here.

93
00:09:52,166 --> 00:09:53,666
Why did they die?

94
00:09:54,166 --> 00:09:56,833
My sister loved a guy...

95
00:09:56,916 --> 00:10:00,291
...so my dad and brothers
locked her up, beat her.

96
00:10:00,958 --> 00:10:05,458
Next day, she heard that
the guy she loved was killed.

97
00:10:05,875 --> 00:10:08,833
She broke open the door, ran out
and jumped into the well.

98
00:10:09,333 --> 00:10:12,833
Mom cried all the time.

99
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:17,500
Dad always scolded her,
sometimes even beat her.

100
00:10:17,708 --> 00:10:20,666
One day, she fed me pooris...

101
00:10:20,750 --> 00:10:22,791
...and then killed herself.

102
00:10:25,833 --> 00:10:29,708
Ugh! Why are you crying?
Men don't cry.

103
00:10:31,291 --> 00:10:32,375
Subbu...

104
00:10:33,833 --> 00:10:34,875
Yeah?

105
00:10:34,958 --> 00:10:37,500
Your dad and brothers... are they bad?

106
00:10:40,458 --> 00:10:43,208
No, no. Not that bad.

107
00:10:45,750 --> 00:10:47,458
Actually, come see for yourself.

108
00:10:59,875 --> 00:11:03,375
Hey lil’ brother!
Who's this little runt?

109
00:11:03,458 --> 00:11:05,291
My friend, Karthi.

110
00:11:05,583 --> 00:11:07,166
Oh my! Come in.

111
00:11:08,250 --> 00:11:11,791
-Which grade are you in?
-Same as him. Fifth grade.

112
00:11:12,041 --> 00:11:15,750
Study well or I'll skin you like a rabbit!

113
00:11:15,958 --> 00:11:17,958
Hey! They're just kids.

114
00:11:18,208 --> 00:11:22,208
Dad, some food for Subbu and his friend!

115
00:11:30,208 --> 00:11:32,458
Try some of this marrow, brother!

116
00:11:33,541 --> 00:11:35,208
What 'type' of people are you?

117
00:11:35,291 --> 00:11:37,500
I'm male type. Mom's female type.

118
00:11:42,458 --> 00:11:44,250
Dad’s pissed!

119
00:11:44,458 --> 00:11:46,083
What does your father do?

120
00:11:46,333 --> 00:11:49,208
He died. Mom sells paniyarams.

121
00:11:49,541 --> 00:11:51,166
We moved here a month ago.

122
00:11:51,291 --> 00:11:52,291
Subbu!

123
00:11:53,083 --> 00:11:55,666
Both of you eat outside. Go!

124
00:12:00,708 --> 00:12:04,458
Dad, we can’t expect Subbu to only
mingle within our caste.

125
00:12:04,541 --> 00:12:07,250
They’re just kids.

126
00:12:07,333 --> 00:12:08,958
Let them hang out.

127
00:12:11,583 --> 00:12:13,375
VEERAYYA PAWN SHOP

128
00:12:16,458 --> 00:12:17,458
Sir!

129
00:12:18,041 --> 00:12:19,041
Sir!

130
00:12:19,375 --> 00:12:22,583
My child's dying in the hospital, sir!

131
00:12:22,750 --> 00:12:26,500
I need my jewels back
to pay for his treatment.

132
00:12:26,583 --> 00:12:30,125
Why are your brothers
so much older than you?

133
00:12:30,250 --> 00:12:31,083
Hey!

134
00:12:31,666 --> 00:12:33,333
What's with the mumbling?

135
00:12:33,416 --> 00:12:35,000
It's nothing, Vadivu brother.

136
00:12:35,166 --> 00:12:39,958
He's asking why my brothers
are much older than me.

137
00:12:40,583 --> 00:12:43,208
I haven’t thought about it.
Do you know why?

138
00:12:43,541 --> 00:12:45,000
Story time!

139
00:12:45,083 --> 00:12:48,125
When your sister was born,
your dad was ashamed...

140
00:12:48,208 --> 00:12:49,208
... because she was a girl.

141
00:12:49,291 --> 00:12:51,166
Terrified he'd poison the baby…

142
00:12:51,250 --> 00:12:55,125
…your mom stopped sleeping with him
until your sister became a woman.

143
00:13:00,375 --> 00:13:02,625
I'll pay you back in two months...

144
00:13:02,708 --> 00:13:05,541
...even if it costs me my head!

145
00:13:05,708 --> 00:13:08,666
There are other ways to pay me, darling.

146
00:13:11,458 --> 00:13:15,333
So you're the lion cub born to a
sex-starved bull!

147
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:17,000
Asshole!

148
00:13:17,291 --> 00:13:20,166
-I'll rip your guts out, asshole!
-No.

149
00:13:20,500 --> 00:13:22,291
These two have
nothing better to do!

150
00:13:22,916 --> 00:13:24,833
-Move.
-I'm gonna kill you!

151
00:13:27,208 --> 00:13:28,125
Don't fuck with me!

152
00:13:28,208 --> 00:13:29,416
Wait! Just wait and see!

153
00:13:29,500 --> 00:13:30,708
Suck me!

154
00:13:30,916 --> 00:13:31,875
Hey!

155
00:13:31,958 --> 00:13:33,166
-See what I do to you!
-Let's see you try!

156
00:13:33,250 --> 00:13:34,166
Move aside!

157
00:13:34,458 --> 00:13:37,041
I'll hunt you down
even if you run to Madras!

158
00:13:37,916 --> 00:13:38,916
Listen!

159
00:13:39,541 --> 00:13:42,041
Just like your son's life
matters to you...

160
00:13:42,583 --> 00:13:44,833
...my money matters to me.

161
00:13:45,083 --> 00:13:46,000
Understood?

162
00:13:46,083 --> 00:13:48,708
I'll tell you how to repay the interest.

163
00:13:49,291 --> 00:13:50,750
Fuck off now.

164
00:13:52,250 --> 00:13:54,958
-Now playing at Ganesh Cinemas, Sevapatti
-Sir, my daughter’s wedding…

165
00:13:55,125 --> 00:13:57,958
...with music by Maestro Ilaiyaraaja,
directed by Mani Ratnam...

166
00:13:58,083 --> 00:14:01,458
...starring Kamal Haasan and Saranya,
Nayakan!

167
00:14:01,708 --> 00:14:05,166
Tell me now. Are they good or bad?

168
00:14:05,250 --> 00:14:07,000
I’m clueless...

169
00:14:12,875 --> 00:14:15,041
Why the rush? Who’s this?

170
00:14:15,250 --> 00:14:17,125
This is my friend Subbu.

171
00:14:18,041 --> 00:14:19,500
Go inside. I’ll come.

172
00:14:20,708 --> 00:14:22,708
Ma! I went to his house.

173
00:14:22,791 --> 00:14:25,458
His dad and brothers look like gangsters.

174
00:14:25,708 --> 00:14:27,041
He doesn't have a mother.

175
00:14:27,375 --> 00:14:28,416
Don't say that.

176
00:14:28,791 --> 00:14:30,166
Think of me as your mother.

177
00:14:30,791 --> 00:14:32,458
You're my son too.

178
00:14:34,291 --> 00:14:35,291
Why are you crying?

179
00:14:35,791 --> 00:14:37,166
Mom's right here.

180
00:14:37,750 --> 00:14:39,625
Thinking of your mother, my dear?

181
00:14:40,791 --> 00:14:43,041
Are you crying, Subbu?

182
00:14:43,541 --> 00:14:45,000
Men don't cry.

183
00:14:45,083 --> 00:14:47,791
Who says only women must cry?

184
00:14:47,875 --> 00:14:50,083
Macho nonsense!

185
00:14:51,458 --> 00:14:53,208
See how he laughs!

186
00:14:55,875 --> 00:14:57,875
Give me a Bruce Lee haircut.

187
00:14:57,958 --> 00:14:58,791
Sure.

188
00:14:59,500 --> 00:15:02,583
Karthi, you already look like
actor Rajinikanth.

189
00:15:03,041 --> 00:15:05,333
This guy? Rajinikanth?

190
00:15:07,791 --> 00:15:09,458
Don't be fooled, mom.

191
00:15:09,541 --> 00:15:11,541
He fights at school all the time.

192
00:15:11,958 --> 00:15:13,000
Like Bruce Lee!

193
00:15:13,083 --> 00:15:15,833
He has no one to guide him.
You're no better!

194
00:15:15,916 --> 00:15:19,541
Karthi! Why are you begging them?
Come on! Hit them!

195
00:15:20,541 --> 00:15:23,458
Don't go looking for trouble, boys.
Only hard work pays.

196
00:15:26,333 --> 00:15:29,208
Who's that? He looks scary.

197
00:15:29,333 --> 00:15:32,208
That's Vadivu, the village gangster.

198
00:15:32,416 --> 00:15:36,041
When we grow up,
let's become gangsters like him.

199
00:15:36,458 --> 00:15:37,875
Gangsters?

200
00:15:50,250 --> 00:15:52,583
How can you become a gangster
if you don't drink?

201
00:15:52,666 --> 00:15:53,875
Drink up!

202
00:16:01,541 --> 00:16:02,750
Take this.

203
00:16:02,916 --> 00:16:06,625
Kill Daaka, and you'll earn
the respect of my caste people.

204
00:16:06,708 --> 00:16:07,916
-Hey!
-What?

205
00:16:08,208 --> 00:16:09,416
That's Dhanam's brother.

206
00:16:09,500 --> 00:16:11,583
Oh! Your lover's brother, huh?

207
00:16:14,375 --> 00:16:15,458
Buddy!

208
00:16:16,125 --> 00:16:18,708
Ever eaten a sunny-side up
without breaking the yolk?

209
00:16:18,791 --> 00:16:20,833
-No.
-Watch and learn.

210
00:16:20,958 --> 00:16:22,666
Pick it up like this and...

211
00:16:22,833 --> 00:16:24,375
Awesome!

212
00:16:25,583 --> 00:16:26,666
Hey Subbu…

213
00:16:26,916 --> 00:16:29,416
I can’t wait to kiss a girl like this!

214
00:16:29,500 --> 00:16:30,541
Hey!

215
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:32,583
Don't stain the floor!

216
00:16:33,208 --> 00:16:35,041
Hurry up! The porn is about to start!

217
00:16:35,166 --> 00:16:36,666
-Karthi...
-What is it?

218
00:16:36,750 --> 00:16:38,208
I have to tell you something.

219
00:16:39,958 --> 00:16:41,750
Why are you blushing
like a fuckin’ eunuch?

220
00:16:42,125 --> 00:16:46,250
Oh! Thinking of your lover Dhanam, huh?

221
00:16:46,833 --> 00:16:47,666
Lover, my foot.

222
00:16:47,750 --> 00:16:50,416
Hey, who's gonna pay for all those eggs?

223
00:16:50,500 --> 00:16:52,208
Kindness has no price, brother!

224
00:16:52,291 --> 00:16:54,333
Stop messing around and pay up!

225
00:16:54,458 --> 00:16:55,500
Drunkards!

226
00:16:58,916 --> 00:17:01,791
Kids these days are such wimps.

227
00:17:01,958 --> 00:17:04,625
It's not even started,
and he's already lost his stomach.

228
00:17:05,541 --> 00:17:06,750
Hey fossil!

229
00:17:07,333 --> 00:17:10,958
Can you even get it up?
I'll mess you up, rascal!

230
00:17:11,041 --> 00:17:12,375
Hey!

231
00:17:25,708 --> 00:17:26,875
-Karthi.
-Yeah?

232
00:17:26,958 --> 00:17:28,916
Stop Daaka and keep him distracted.

233
00:17:29,041 --> 00:17:29,875
Okay, brother.

234
00:17:31,333 --> 00:17:32,416
-Subbu.
-Yeah?

235
00:17:32,583 --> 00:17:36,875
While he's talking, sneak up behind him
and slash his calf.

236
00:17:37,208 --> 00:17:40,666
Cover his mouth before he screams
and stab him in the chest.

237
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:43,791
Even if he escapes,
he'll run past this corner.

238
00:17:43,875 --> 00:17:45,166
I'll handle him here.

239
00:17:48,208 --> 00:17:51,208
If things go south,
you guys come here too.

240
00:17:51,375 --> 00:17:54,750
Your first kill is like your wedding
night. Don't get nervous.

241
00:18:10,625 --> 00:18:12,708
Run!

242
00:18:13,083 --> 00:18:14,541
Run! Call Vadivu!

243
00:18:14,625 --> 00:18:16,625
Vadivu brother!

244
00:18:18,291 --> 00:18:19,125
Hey!

245
00:18:19,250 --> 00:18:20,333
Call Vadivu!

246
00:18:20,500 --> 00:18:22,333
Hey! Stay there!

247
00:18:22,416 --> 00:18:23,750
Vadivu is not here!

248
00:18:25,291 --> 00:18:27,208
Who's that Vadivu?

249
00:18:27,583 --> 00:18:28,583
Hey!

250
00:18:28,750 --> 00:18:30,041
You son of a...

251
00:18:32,458 --> 00:18:34,416
You think you’re Bruce Lee, huh?

252
00:18:34,833 --> 00:18:35,875
Ah!

253
00:18:36,625 --> 00:18:37,958
How dare you touch him!

254
00:18:46,708 --> 00:18:47,791
Subbu! Come!

255
00:18:47,875 --> 00:18:49,375
Let us go, Daaka! Please!

256
00:18:49,458 --> 00:18:51,083
Why the fuck are you begging him?

257
00:18:55,666 --> 00:18:56,708
Karthi!

258
00:18:57,625 --> 00:19:00,125
Your friend's gonna die now!

259
00:19:00,208 --> 00:19:01,541
No! Please don't, Daaka!

260
00:19:01,625 --> 00:19:03,291
How dare he tries to kill me!

261
00:19:07,125 --> 00:19:10,458
Both of you skip town for six months.

262
