This isn't disgusting.

1053
01:15:33,791 --> 01:15:35,500
This is a different kind of beauty.

1054
01:15:44,833 --> 01:15:48,916
I have a friend just like you.

1055
01:15:49,208 --> 01:15:54,458
She went to the Bahuchara
Mata temple in Becharaji, Gujarat.

1056
01:15:54,791 --> 01:15:56,583
They conduct a festival every December.

1057
01:15:56,833 --> 01:16:01,000
She went there and
transformed into a woman.

1058
01:16:01,083 --> 01:16:06,083
She now lives bravely and happily
as a woman.

1059
01:16:08,083 --> 01:16:09,333
You must go there too.

1060
01:16:10,333 --> 01:16:14,416
Will you come with me?
I can't do this alone, Dorothy.

1061
01:16:15,250 --> 01:16:16,333
Of course.

1062
01:16:16,875 --> 01:16:18,208
December isn't far off.

1063
01:16:18,333 --> 01:16:22,541
Until then, continue wearing Subbu's mask.

1064
01:16:24,791 --> 01:16:25,833
Look here.

1065
01:16:27,375 --> 01:16:28,541
You shouldn't cry.

1066
01:16:30,083 --> 01:16:31,625
Women should never cry.

1067
01:16:59,958 --> 01:17:06,333
♪ Born to live, my child ♪

1068
01:17:06,500 --> 01:17:10,125
We thought we'd find his body
but this is all we got.

1069
01:17:10,250 --> 01:17:13,000
I don't know where he disappeared.
Fuckin' degenerate!

1070
01:17:18,416 --> 01:17:21,125
I carried him on my shoulders
as a child.

1071
01:17:22,166 --> 01:17:23,875
How did he turn out like this?

1072
01:17:24,791 --> 01:17:26,041
He's defying us!

1073
01:17:27,666 --> 01:17:30,250
We are respected in this village.

1074
01:17:31,666 --> 01:17:33,500
He'll disgrace us, dad!

1075
01:17:34,708 --> 01:17:36,291
We might as well hang ourselves!

1076
01:17:36,375 --> 01:17:41,291
It’s not a fighting rooster
but a bloody hen. Slaughter it!

1077
01:17:41,458 --> 01:17:45,208
♪ Born to live, my child ♪

1078
01:17:52,458 --> 01:17:54,416
Hey, Karthi's here.

1079
01:17:58,333 --> 01:17:59,458
Karthi…

1080
01:17:59,541 --> 01:18:03,500
What happened, brother?
The truck office said it was urgent.

1081
01:18:03,583 --> 01:18:05,166
Is something wrong?

1082
01:18:06,791 --> 01:18:10,166
Our village cop has been
waiting two days for you.

1083
01:18:11,958 --> 01:18:13,583
He's not telling me why.

1084
01:18:15,958 --> 01:18:18,250
I don't know if they're digging
into Vaseegaran's murder.

1085
01:18:19,208 --> 01:18:20,500
What is it, sir?

1086
01:18:21,791 --> 01:18:24,375
Does Whistle sir know you're here?

1087
01:18:26,041 --> 01:18:27,500
Calm down, kid.

1088
01:18:28,458 --> 01:18:31,166
He's the one who sent me.

1089
01:18:34,208 --> 01:18:37,750
He wants you to do one more murder.

1090
01:18:40,333 --> 01:18:41,541
I don't understand, sir.

1091
01:18:41,625 --> 01:18:47,208
He wants his youngest son Subbu killed.
And he wants you to do it.

1092
01:18:47,416 --> 01:18:50,291
He asked me to bring you back home.
Let's go?

1093
01:18:54,166 --> 01:18:55,208
Subbu?

1094
01:19:02,500 --> 01:19:03,625
Sir!

1095
01:19:04,750 --> 01:19:08,958
Why would he want Subbu dead?
That's his own son.

1096
01:19:13,000 --> 01:19:16,791
Stop joking, sir. Tell me why you're here.

1097
01:19:22,083 --> 01:19:23,625
My heart's about to explode!

1098
01:19:23,916 --> 01:19:24,958
He's become a eunuch?

1099
01:19:25,166 --> 01:19:27,541
Their clan twirls
its moustache with pride.

1100
01:19:27,750 --> 01:19:29,458
How will they swallow this shame?

1101
01:19:30,083 --> 01:19:32,375
They don't want to kill him themselves.

1102
01:19:32,708 --> 01:19:35,041
They won't hire outsiders either.

1103
01:19:35,375 --> 01:19:37,916
If word got out, they'd be disgraced.

1104
01:19:38,500 --> 01:19:40,583
This isn't humiliating just for them...

1105
01:19:40,708 --> 01:19:41,958
...but for Karthi too.

1106
01:19:42,083 --> 01:19:45,166
You've been best friends
with that scum since childhood.

1107
01:19:45,333 --> 01:19:47,541
How will you ever show your face
in the village again?

1108
01:19:47,708 --> 01:19:50,041
That degenerate must be loitering
in a nearby town.

1109
01:19:50,208 --> 01:19:53,583
Find it, act friendly...

1110
01:19:53,791 --> 01:19:55,250
...and then kill it.

1111
01:19:56,666 --> 01:19:58,958
They said it’d go anywhere with you.

1112
01:20:01,541 --> 01:20:03,000
Sir, how can I...

1113
01:20:03,666 --> 01:20:05,208
...kill Subbu?

1114
01:20:06,250 --> 01:20:07,500
I can’t, sir.

1115
01:20:08,041 --> 01:20:10,958
Fine, then start a family with it.

1116
01:20:14,458 --> 01:20:16,125
Sounds disgusting, right?

1117
01:20:16,291 --> 01:20:18,833
You don't have a choice, kid.
You have to do it.

1118
01:20:18,958 --> 01:20:21,083
Whistle sir has done so much for you.

1119
01:20:21,500 --> 01:20:24,708
You're a free man,
even after killing Vaseegaran.

1120
01:20:25,000 --> 01:20:27,125
Don't you want this freedom all your life?

1121
01:20:27,458 --> 01:20:31,583
We don't choose the things we do.
It's his fate to die like this.

1122
01:20:31,875 --> 01:20:32,875
Let's go.

1123
01:20:32,958 --> 01:20:36,083
I have to hand you over to Whistle sir
and report back to duty.

1124
01:20:36,166 --> 01:20:38,166
I'm running out of leave.

1125
01:20:39,000 --> 01:20:41,458
Hey, get in the truck.

1126
01:20:46,291 --> 01:20:47,500
Dindigul Bus Stand! Get down!

1127
01:21:03,958 --> 01:21:06,958
-Can I have some food, brother?
-Ask him.

1128
01:21:09,125 --> 01:21:10,916
Sir... I'm hungry.

1129
01:21:11,000 --> 01:21:12,041
Got money?

1130
01:21:13,291 --> 01:21:14,541
Does this look like a charity?

1131
01:21:14,750 --> 01:21:16,416
Go beg somewhere and
come back with money.

1132
01:21:16,958 --> 01:21:18,541
Don't stand here. Get lost!

1133
01:21:19,458 --> 01:21:21,083
Don't piss me off! Leave!

1134
01:21:26,125 --> 01:21:27,791
-Got any change?
-Get lost!

1135
01:21:27,875 --> 01:21:29,291
Got any change?

1136
01:21:29,416 --> 01:21:31,958
Don’t ruin my business. Go on!

1137
01:21:39,916 --> 01:21:40,750
Lady...

1138
01:21:42,125 --> 01:21:43,833
My daughter has an exam tomorrow.

1139
01:21:43,916 --> 01:21:46,583
Please bless her to do well.

1140
01:21:53,541 --> 01:21:54,583
Here.

1141
01:21:55,708 --> 01:21:57,125
Take this.

1142
01:22:33,208 --> 01:22:34,208
Mom...

1143
01:22:35,500 --> 01:22:37,208
Oh god! Subbu!

1144
01:22:38,791 --> 01:22:40,708
Don't cry, my darling!

1145
01:22:41,375 --> 01:22:43,375
Why didn't you come straight to mom?

1146
01:22:43,500 --> 01:22:45,500
I wouldn’t have let you suffer like this.

1147
01:22:45,583 --> 01:22:46,833
No, mom…

1148
01:22:47,416 --> 01:22:50,166
My family won't let you live in peace.

1149
01:22:56,791 --> 01:22:59,416
Can you ask Karthi to take me away?

1150
01:22:59,625 --> 01:23:03,000
Only he can save me from this hell.

1151
01:23:03,541 --> 01:23:05,791
He calls once a week.

1152
01:23:05,875 --> 01:23:08,541
I'll tell him.
He'll come and take you away.

1153
01:23:08,625 --> 01:23:10,000
Here, eat this.

1154
01:23:29,291 --> 01:23:31,958
Karthi, Subbu came to see me.

1155
01:23:33,458 --> 01:23:35,666
He wants to go somewhere up north.

1156
01:23:35,875 --> 01:23:38,291
Take him there and drop him off.

1157
01:23:38,500 --> 01:23:40,958
I can't bear to see him suffer.

1158
01:23:41,083 --> 01:23:44,833
The poor boy's begging for food
at Dindigul Bus Stand.

1159
01:23:48,333 --> 01:23:49,416
Karthi?

1160
01:23:50,250 --> 01:23:51,166
Karthi?

1161
01:23:51,541 --> 01:23:53,000
Why aren't you replying?

1162
01:23:53,791 --> 01:23:55,458
I'll call you later, mom.

1163
01:24:00,541 --> 01:24:03,041
Honour is everything.

1164
01:24:03,375 --> 01:24:05,041
The rest is bullshit.

1165
01:24:05,625 --> 01:24:08,458
For you and for us,
honour is everything!

1166
01:24:09,541 --> 01:24:12,250
Take him somewhere far away and kill him.

1167
01:24:12,708 --> 01:24:13,791
Hey!

1168
01:24:15,166 --> 01:24:19,791
If you screw this up, I’ll skin you alive.

1169
01:24:20,333 --> 01:24:22,708
I swear on my mother's soul!

1170
01:24:25,000 --> 01:24:28,291
Don’t forget, your mother lives here too.

1171
01:24:38,333 --> 01:24:40,166
Send word once it's done.

1172
01:24:40,583 --> 01:24:42,875
These two will come
to perform the last rites.

1173
01:24:43,708 --> 01:24:45,750
Don't dump the body anywhere.

1174
01:24:46,208 --> 01:24:53,083
Remove the family amulet
and the locket from the corpse.

1175
01:24:55,000 --> 01:24:56,708
Take an oath!

1176
01:25:05,666 --> 01:25:08,416
Their whole life is a living hell.

1177
01:25:08,916 --> 01:25:11,458
Rather than begging,
selling their bodies...

1178
01:25:11,541 --> 01:25:14,166
...and being abused until they die...

1179
01:25:14,250 --> 01:25:16,958
...a swift death by your hand
would be kinder.

1180
01:25:18,875 --> 01:25:21,041
When a cow falls sick...

1181
01:25:21,125 --> 01:25:24,250
...don't we offer a prayer
and then put it down?

1182
01:25:24,333 --> 01:25:27,041
Think of it as a liberation
for the poor soul.

1183
01:25:28,000 --> 01:25:29,500
A mercy killing.

1184
01:25:37,083 --> 01:25:39,333
You've been inseparable since childhood.

1185
01:25:42,666 --> 01:25:46,750
It's his fate to die by your hand.

1186
01:26:19,208 --> 01:26:20,333
Subbu!

1187
01:26:23,958 --> 01:26:25,041
Subbu!

1188
01:26:28,500 --> 01:26:29,541
Subbu!

1189
01:26:33,250 --> 01:26:34,416
Subbu!

1190
01:26:38,125 --> 01:26:39,208
Subbu?

1191
01:26:46,041 --> 01:26:47,041
Subbu!

1192
01:26:56,041 --> 01:26:57,458
Subbu!

1193
01:27:12,208 --> 01:27:13,208
Karthi!

1194
01:27:34,625 --> 01:27:35,666
Karthi!

1195
01:27:37,750 --> 01:27:38,791
Yuck!

1196
01:27:40,166 --> 01:27:41,916
What the hell is this disguise?

1197
01:27:43,375 --> 01:27:44,541
Yuck?

1198
01:27:46,708 --> 01:27:48,416
This isn't a disguise.

1199
01:27:49,125 --> 01:27:50,416
This is the real me.

1200
01:27:51,166 --> 01:27:53,208
Everything before this was the disguise.

1201
01:27:53,875 --> 01:27:54,958
And you say "Yuck"?

1202
01:27:55,083 --> 01:27:56,041
Am I so disgus...

1203
01:27:56,125 --> 01:27:57,125
Shut up!

1204
01:27:57,208 --> 01:27:59,166
Shut up! Not a word!

1205
01:28:01,583 --> 01:28:03,500
Mom said you wanted to go somewhere.

1206
01:28:03,583 --> 01:28:05,791
Tell me where,
and I'll drop you there!

1207
01:28:06,750 --> 01:28:08,875
It's disgusting to
see you like this!

1208
01:28:10,083 --> 01:28:11,125
That's enough…

1209
01:28:12,625 --> 01:28:15,291
-Just drop me somew-
-Not a fuckin’ word!

1210
01:28:15,541 --> 01:28:18,083
Wear these clothes and
get into the truck like a man.

1211
01:28:18,625 --> 01:28:19,708
Yuck!

1212
01:28:20,458 --> 01:28:22,541
Seeing you like this... ugh!

1213
01:28:53,458 --> 01:28:54,750
Dude!

1214
01:28:58,000 --> 01:28:59,375
You really lost your cool!

1215
01:29:00,375 --> 01:29:01,500
I get it.

1216
01:29:02,000 --> 01:29:05,208
You haven’t seen me like this.
But you'll get used to me.

1217
01:29:05,500 --> 01:29:10,166
Seeing you, all my troubles have vanished.

1218
01:29:10,791 --> 01:29:12,166
This trip’s gonna be fun!

1219
01:29:12,333 --> 01:29:14,708
♪ Country roads! ♪

1220
01:29:14,791 --> 01:29:15,666
Dude!

1221
01:29:15,958 --> 01:29:18,041
♪ Take me home! ♪

1222
01:29:18,333 --> 01:29:21,083
Fuck my life!

1223
01:29:23,833 --> 01:29:26,958
Your voice, your behaviour, your walk...

1224
01:29:27,208 --> 01:29:30,416
Ugh! My skin crawls
when you touch me, man.

1225
01:29:30,625 --> 01:29:33,833
Oh my! We've got a drama king here.

1226
01:29:34,041 --> 01:29:36,708
From now, don't call me "man".
Call me "girl".

1227
01:29:36,791 --> 01:29:38,333
Didn't I ask you to shut the fuck up?

1228
01:29:39,000 --> 01:29:40,041
Asshole!

1229
01:29:40,250 --> 01:29:41,916
Unbutton your fuckin’ collar!

1230
01:29:42,000 --> 01:29:45,000
Say another word
and I'll fuckin' stab you!

1231
01:29:45,166 --> 01:29:46,250
Stab me?

1232
01:29:46,833 --> 01:29:48,791
You just might!
Typical dumb male!

1233
01:29:55,000 --> 01:29:59,416
Only Dorothy and Dhanam
knew the truth about me.

1234
01:31:14,125 --> 01:31:14,958
Hey!

1235
01:31:15,333 --> 01:31:16,666
You bloody idiot!

1236
01:31:16,916 --> 01:31:18,291
Don’t die! Sit properly!

1237
01:31:59,166 --> 01:32:00,166
Don't do it, Karthi.

1238
01:32:00,250 --> 01:32:01,750
You know how much blood I've seen.

1239
01:32:01,833 --> 01:32:03,875
Today, I'm washing dirty plates.

1240
01:32:08,833 --> 01:32:11,208
Are we god to decide if he lives or dies?

1241
01:32:12,333 --> 01:32:13,500
We're stupid fuckin' humans!

1242
01:32:17,375 --> 01:32:18,458
Karthi!

1243
01:32:19,083 --> 01:32:20,958
Why are you staring at a woman bathing?

1244
01:32:22,083 --> 01:32:25,875
I'm not the same anymore, Karthi.
Turn away.

1245
01:32:26,041 --> 01:32:27,125
I'm feeling shy!

1246
01:32:41,833 --> 01:32:43,916
So... what else?

1247
01:32:47,458 --> 01:32:48,500
Oh my!

1248
01:32:49,625 --> 01:32:51,416
So what if you turn it off? I'll sing!

1249
01:32:51,500 --> 01:32:55,041
♪ O saffron flower! O saffron flower! ♪

1250
01:32:55,125 --> 01:32:58,458
♪ Where’s my king? Where’s my king? ♪

1251
01:32:58,541 --> 01:33:00,750
Shut the fuck up, dumbass!

1252
01:33:06,208 --> 01:33:07,666
Stop being so grumpy!

1253
01:33:08,416 --> 01:33:10,083
Aren't you a Rajinikanth fan?

1254
01:33:10,791 --> 01:33:12,458
Then why all these Bruce Lee photos?

1255
01:33:12,541 --> 01:33:14,125
You missed me, didn't you?

1256
01:33:14,958 --> 01:33:16,000
So much affection!

1257
01:33:17,500 --> 01:33:18,833
Yeah!

1258
01:33:19,416 --> 01:33:22,625
I stuck them up because
I missed my friend Subbu.

1259
01:33:23,333 --> 01:33:25,458
Not for a fuckin’ ladyboy like you!

1260
01:34:05,333 --> 01:34:06,791
It's not yet done.

1261
01:34:07,000 --> 01:34:08,541
I'll do it in a few days.

1262
01:34:08,625 --> 01:34:11,500
What! You think you're on
a fuckin' holiday?

1263
01:34:12,541 --> 01:34:14,083
What are you looking at?

1264
01:34:14,541 --> 01:34:16,250
Is that a man or a woman?

1265
01:34:17,208 --> 01:34:19,250
Let's find out!

1266
01:34:19,375 --> 01:34:20,666
I'll go first.

1267
01:34:20,791 --> 01:34:21,708
Wait... I'll go.

1268
01:34:21,791 --> 01:34:24,083
Doesn’t matter as long as they're hot!

1269
01:34:24,291 --> 01:34:25,875
I'd tap that!

1270
01:34:26,875 --> 01:34:28,625
Go on! Enjoy!

1271
01:34:30,125 --> 01:34:32,750
Hey! Want a banana?

1272
01:34:34,125 --> 01:34:35,458
It’ll be done.

1273
01:34:36,208 --> 01:34:37,833
I didn't get the right chance.

1274
01:34:37,916 --> 01:34:41,958
The right chance? you fuckin' bastard!
Stop messing with...

1275
01:34:59,666 --> 01:35:01,583
-Hey! Just five minutes!
-Please don't!

1276
01:35:01,666 --> 01:35:05,875
You have until Saturday
to kill him and tell us where to come.

1277
01:35:05,958 --> 01:35:08,791
If you don't, come back here on Sunday...

1278
01:35:08,875 --> 01:35:10,750
...for your mother's funeral.

1279
01:35:10,958 --> 01:35:12,375
Brother!

1280
01:35:12,541 --> 01:35:14,208
Brother!

1281
01:35:18,291 --> 01:35:20,875
Brother! I'm sorry!

1282
01:35:23,833 --> 01:35:24,875
Asshole!

1283
01:35:44,083 --> 01:35:45,958
-Don't, brother!
-Asshole!

1284
01:36:23,583 --> 01:36:25,625
Finish him off, god.

1285
01:36:29,708 --> 01:36:30,875
Don't, brother!

1286
01:36:30,958 --> 01:36:32,041
Hey! Let go!

1287
01:36:33,916 --> 01:36:35,541
We're god's children...

1288
01:36:35,625 --> 01:36:38,625
...sent down to bear
the sins of this world.

1289
01:36:38,791 --> 01:36:41,958
We're a hundred times stronger than men.

1290
01:36:42,333 --> 01:36:44,750
But if we start fighting back...

1291
01:36:44,833 --> 01:36:47,833
...we'd have to fight
a thousand men every day.

1292
01:36:49,750 --> 01:36:53,458
We have to bear it, endure it...
as much as possible.

1293
01:36:53,791 --> 01:36:56,416
But when limits are crossed,
we have no option...

1294
01:36:56,500 --> 01:36:58,000
…but to fight back.

1295
01:38:19,500 --> 01:38:20,583
Wait.

1296
01:38:21,000 --> 01:38:22,083
Lady!

1297
01:38:22,458 --> 01:38:24,000
This truck's going that way.

1298
01:38:25,958 --> 01:38:27,375
Please drop them off.

1299
01:38:29,125 --> 01:38:31,791
Someone's going towards the temple.
Get up!

1300
01:38:32,000 --> 01:38:33,458
I'll check if he'll drop us.

1301
01:38:33,625 --> 01:38:36,833
Brother, can you drop us off at the…

1302
01:38:50,500 --> 01:38:51,791
You!

1303
01:38:52,083 --> 01:38:53,208
What happened?

1304
01:38:53,500 --> 01:38:54,625
What happened?

1305
01:38:55,166 --> 01:38:57,750
He's the monster who crushed me
like a worm the other day!

1306
01:38:57,833 --> 01:38:59,041
Don't spare him!

1307
01:39:02,291 --> 01:39:04,125
Didn't you get enough already?

1308
01:39:04,333 --> 01:39:05,541
Fuck off, you bitch!

1309
01:39:05,625 --> 01:39:07,458
I should’ve killed you that day.

1310
01:39:09,041 --> 01:39:10,833
Try me! Come!

1311
01:39:11,208 --> 01:39:12,375
Get lost!

1312
01:39:13,125 --> 01:39:14,166
Lady...

1313
01:39:15,791 --> 01:39:16,875
Forgive me!

1314
01:39:27,791 --> 01:39:29,541
Don't cry, my dear.

1315
01:39:30,250 --> 01:39:31,708
When I touched you that day...

1316
01:39:31,833 --> 01:39:34,833
...I knew you'd come looking for me.

1317
01:39:35,666 --> 01:39:37,458
Okay... don't cry.

1318
01:39:37,750 --> 01:39:40,208
Mom will take care of you from now.

1319
01:39:43,416 --> 01:39:45,125
We're going there too, girl.

1320
01:39:45,333 --> 01:39:48,041
These two will have their nirvaanam there.

1321
01:39:48,166 --> 01:39:50,583
You can join our family.

1322
01:39:50,666 --> 01:39:52,833
I’ll help you through
your nirvaanam procedure.

1323
01:39:53,375 --> 01:39:55,458
Nirvaanam?

1324
01:39:55,625 --> 01:39:58,166
Why is your shirt torn and bloody?

1325
01:39:58,250 --> 01:39:59,875
Hey, bring your saree.

1326
01:39:59,958 --> 01:40:01,083
No!

1327
01:40:03,083 --> 01:40:04,333
He doesn't like it.

1328
01:40:08,833 --> 01:40:10,666
If you don't like our clothes...

1329
01:40:11,208 --> 01:40:13,125
…give her yours.

1330
01:40:14,916 --> 01:40:16,250
Do we look like monsters?

1331
01:40:16,375 --> 01:40:18,875
Why are you flinching?

1332
01:40:19,625 --> 01:40:20,916
You bloody man!

1333
01:40:21,083 --> 01:40:23,750
Drop us off safely.

1334
01:40:23,833 --> 01:40:26,625
I'll wash away your sins
and let you prosper.

1335
01:40:27,083 --> 01:40:29,291
Understood?

1336
01:40:33,250 --> 01:40:34,791
You think I'm a joker?

1337
01:40:34,875 --> 01:40:37,500
He flinches when I touch him!

1338
01:40:39,416 --> 01:40:41,875
How did you find this character?

1339
01:40:50,291 --> 01:40:52,000
Didn't you buy this shirt last Diwali?

1340
01:40:52,541 --> 01:40:54,083
It fits me so well.

1341
01:40:55,541 --> 01:40:57,375
Isn't this place beautiful?

1342
01:40:57,458 --> 01:40:58,458
Hang on!

1343
01:41:03,625 --> 01:41:04,458
Hey!

1344
01:41:04,875 --> 01:41:06,375
Go join them in the back!

1345
01:41:06,875 --> 01:41:07,708
Dumbass choir!

1346
01:41:07,791 --> 01:41:10,750
♪ Did you see the one
who touched you and me? ♪

1347
01:41:13,916 --> 01:41:17,208
♪ Did you hear how I was blindfolded
and left in the woods? ♪

1348
01:41:20,083 --> 01:41:23,083
♪ Did you see the one
who touched you and me? ♪

1349
01:41:23,166 --> 01:41:26,208
♪ Did you hear how I was blindfolded
and left in the woods? ♪

1350
01:41:26,291 --> 01:41:28,958
♪ Did you agree to let him
stick by your side? ♪

1351
01:41:29,041 --> 01:41:32,250
♪ Or did you cut him loose
because you’d get attached? ♪

1352
01:41:32,416 --> 01:41:35,416
♪ What is it? What is it, my dear? ♪

1353
01:41:35,500 --> 01:41:38,416
♪ Tell me! Oh, tell me, darling! ♪

1354
01:41:38,500 --> 01:41:41,875
♪ Did you see the one
who touched you and me? ♪

1355
01:41:43,166 --> 01:41:46,291
♪ Did you hear how I was blindfolded
and left in the woods? ♪

1356
01:41:48,833 --> 01:41:52,541
Karthi! Come join our marbles game!

1357
01:41:52,708 --> 01:41:53,958
Marbles?

1358
01:41:54,041 --> 01:41:56,625
-Here’s a fuckin’ marble for you!
-Ah! Stop it!

1359
01:42:02,083 --> 01:42:04,083
It's customary to perform
the Mata Pooja...

1360
01:42:04,166 --> 01:42:06,000
...before the nirvaanam procedure.

1361
01:42:06,083 --> 01:42:10,125
Since you have no one,
we'll step in as family and do it for you.

1362
01:42:10,208 --> 01:42:14,333
Pray well to Mata.
Nirvaanam is like a rebirth.

1363
01:42:14,416 --> 01:42:16,541
Long live Bahuchara Mata!

1364
01:42:16,625 --> 01:42:19,083
Long live Santoshi Mata!

1365
01:42:19,166 --> 01:42:20,250
Pray well, my dear.

1366
01:42:20,458 --> 01:42:22,250
Live a happy life!

1367
01:42:25,750 --> 01:42:27,666
You're so beautiful, darling!

1368
01:42:28,291 --> 01:42:29,916
See how she blushes!

1369
01:42:30,375 --> 01:42:36,458
♪ Shall I count the guys lost in the
round vermilion on your forehead? ♪

1370
01:42:39,583 --> 01:42:45,666
♪ Has anyone ever escaped the trap
of your big, round eyes? ♪

1371
01:42:48,833 --> 01:42:54,875
♪ He’ll promise you pearls,
then run when he's done with you. ♪

1372
01:42:54,958 --> 01:43:00,833
♪ Listen to me, you beautiful girl.
If you let go, you're a fool. ♪

1373
01:43:01,125 --> 01:43:02,500
♪ Touched you... ♪

1374
01:43:02,583 --> 01:43:04,000
♪ Touched me... ♪

1375
01:43:04,208 --> 01:43:07,208
♪ Did you see the one
who touched you and me? ♪

1376
01:43:07,291 --> 01:43:10,291
♪ Did you hear how I was blindfolded
and left in the woods? ♪

1377
01:43:10,375 --> 01:43:13,041
♪ Did you agree to let him
stick by your side? ♪

1378
01:43:13,125 --> 01:43:16,375
♪ Or did you cut him loose
because you’d get attached? ♪

1379
01:43:16,500 --> 01:43:19,500
♪ What is it? What is it, my dear? ♪

1380
01:43:19,583 --> 01:43:22,500
♪ Tell me! Oh, tell me, darling! ♪

1381
01:43:22,666 --> 01:43:25,833
♪ Did you see the one
who touched you and me? ♪

1382
01:43:27,333 --> 01:43:28,916
-Ah!
-Huh!

1383
01:43:29,166 --> 01:43:30,041
Hey! Come here!

1384
01:43:30,208 --> 01:43:32,875
It hurts, huh?

1385
01:43:36,625 --> 01:43:39,583
Mocking a girl's pain!

1386
01:43:52,208 --> 01:43:53,750
Why are you staring at me?

1387
01:43:54,625 --> 01:43:55,750
You're scaring me.

1388
01:43:57,333 --> 01:43:59,791
You still look at us with disgust.

1389
01:44:00,208 --> 01:44:01,375
It's not just you...

1390
01:44:01,541 --> 01:44:03,208
...the whole world does too.

1391
01:44:03,500 --> 01:44:07,250
This glare is why we're forced to beg...

1392
01:44:07,416 --> 01:44:10,833
sell our bodies or end our lives!

1393
01:44:10,916 --> 01:44:12,291
End our lives!

1394
01:44:14,250 --> 01:44:16,375
Why can't you see us as humans?

1395
01:44:16,458 --> 01:44:19,291
Hey! You were the one glaring at me!

1396
01:44:19,791 --> 01:44:22,250
Ten years! Just ten more years!

1397
01:44:22,333 --> 01:44:24,083
The world will accept us as we are.

1398
01:44:24,166 --> 01:44:28,208
Men like you will be
looked at with disgust!

1399
01:44:28,291 --> 01:44:29,375
Shut up, lady!

1400
01:44:29,458 --> 01:44:32,625
♪ Even if they like you,
these young guys are too shy to learn... ♪

1401
01:44:32,916 --> 01:44:35,500
♪ ...so they'll keep their distance. ♪

1402
01:44:38,750 --> 01:44:41,666
♪ Guide them with patience,
teach them well... ♪

1403
01:44:41,750 --> 01:44:42,875
♪ ...and we'll still make it through. ♪

1404
01:44:42,958 --> 01:44:44,041
Everyone, get down!

1405
01:44:44,500 --> 01:44:46,750
She talked so much, the shaft rod broke.

1406
01:44:47,958 --> 01:44:51,333
♪ Teach them everything,
hold nothing back. ♪

1407
01:44:51,416 --> 01:44:54,125
♪ Learn as you go
without showing off. ♪

1408
01:44:55,250 --> 01:44:56,500
I'll come with him.

1409
01:44:57,125 --> 01:44:58,458
He came all this way for me.

1410
01:44:58,541 --> 01:45:01,666
Oh my! Wherever Romeo goes,
Juliet follows.

1411
01:45:01,750 --> 01:45:03,166
♪ Touched me? ♪

1412
01:45:03,375 --> 01:45:06,458
♪ Did you see the one
who touched you and me? ♪

1413
01:45:06,583 --> 01:45:09,583
There's a hill a hundred kilometers
from here.

1414
01:45:09,666 --> 01:45:12,000
You must drop her off safely.

1415
01:45:17,500 --> 01:45:18,625
Asshole!

1416
01:45:18,875 --> 01:45:21,166
Grinning with them like an idiot!

1417
01:45:22,166 --> 01:45:24,041
How much that woman talks!

1418
01:45:25,583 --> 01:45:27,291
From now, you sit in the back.

1419
01:45:27,625 --> 01:45:29,083
Don't sit beside me.

1420
01:45:30,375 --> 01:45:31,583
You're pissing me off!

1421
01:45:31,666 --> 01:45:37,666
♪ The paths we choose are ours alone! ♪

1422
01:45:37,833 --> 01:45:43,875
♪ Our sorrow is beyond
what words can express! ♪

1423
01:45:57,708 --> 01:46:01,000
They say I was born
on a full moon night.

1424
01:46:02,875 --> 01:46:04,625
So when I was a kid...

1425
01:46:05,041 --> 01:46:07,625
...they used to
celebrate my birthday...

1426
01:46:09,208 --> 01:46:11,166
...every full moon.

1427
01:46:17,416 --> 01:46:18,708
What is it?

1428
01:48:33,875 --> 01:48:34,875
Karthi!

1429
01:48:36,250 --> 01:48:37,375
What happened?

1430
01:48:37,916 --> 01:48:38,791
Nothing.

1431
01:48:38,958 --> 01:48:39,833
Buddy!

1432
01:48:39,958 --> 01:48:41,750
-Why are you sweating so much?
-Nothing!

1433
01:48:42,791 --> 01:48:44,416
Buddy, stop the truck!

1434
01:48:44,500 --> 01:48:45,541
Let me come there!

1435
01:48:45,791 --> 01:48:48,250
Karthi, stop the truck.
Let me come up front!

1436
01:48:50,625 --> 01:48:51,458
Say someth-

1437
01:49:04,250 --> 01:49:05,291
Karthi?

1438
01:49:08,833 --> 01:49:09,750
Buddy?

1439
01:49:18,041 --> 01:49:19,666
Sir. Hospital?

1440
01:49:19,750 --> 01:49:20,583
There.

1441
01:49:20,791 --> 01:49:21,958
-This way?
-Yes.

1442
01:49:25,875 --> 01:49:28,916
My friend... driver...
fainted... sweating!

1443
01:49:29,000 --> 01:49:30,291
-Relax.
-Please come.

1444
01:49:30,625 --> 01:49:32,791
Please come with me!

1445
01:49:33,125 --> 01:49:36,041
Wait! What happened?

1446
01:49:36,125 --> 01:49:37,375
Bring him here.

1447
01:49:37,541 --> 01:49:38,875
I don't get your language.

1448
01:49:38,958 --> 01:49:40,583
We don't have an ambulance.

1449
01:49:40,666 --> 01:49:41,500
No vehicle?

1450
01:49:41,625 --> 01:49:43,083
No ambulance. Bring him here.

1451
01:49:43,375 --> 01:49:44,583
Shall I carry him here?

1452
01:49:44,833 --> 01:49:45,666
Bring him.

1453
01:49:46,333 --> 01:49:47,166
Careful.

1454
01:50:32,041 --> 01:50:33,541
Subbu! Subbu!

1455
01:50:33,625 --> 01:50:34,583
Hey! Hey!

1456
01:50:34,875 --> 01:50:36,625
That's not your friend.

1457
01:50:36,958 --> 01:50:38,583
A beggar.

1458
01:50:38,791 --> 01:50:39,875
He died yesterday.

1459
01:50:41,083 --> 01:50:43,833
He was a beggar from this town.

1460
01:50:44,166 --> 01:50:45,833
Poor guy died all alone.

1461
01:50:46,833 --> 01:50:48,416
You thought it was me?

1462
01:50:48,916 --> 01:50:50,291
So much affection, huh?

1463
01:50:51,166 --> 01:50:52,166
Affection, my foot.

1464
01:50:52,250 --> 01:50:55,916
If not for him,
you'd be dead now.

1465
01:50:56,875 --> 01:50:59,458
She says you'd be
dead if not for me.

1466
01:51:00,000 --> 01:51:01,083
Was that good, doctor?

1467
01:51:01,166 --> 01:51:02,083
Yeah.

1468
01:51:02,458 --> 01:51:04,541
Is the poison out of him?

1469
01:51:34,541 --> 01:51:35,875
Want parottas?

1470
01:51:35,958 --> 01:51:36,791
Parottas?

1471
01:51:36,958 --> 01:51:38,750
The cook's from our town.

1472
01:51:39,000 --> 01:51:40,458
The food tastes
just like back home.

1473
01:51:42,333 --> 01:51:43,166
Go!

1474
01:51:43,541 --> 01:51:44,708
Eat to your heart's content.

1475
01:51:46,750 --> 01:51:47,666
Brother!

1476
01:51:48,250 --> 01:51:49,625
-Are you Tamil?
-Yeah...

1477
01:51:49,916 --> 01:51:51,750
-Tell me.
-Eight parottas...

1478
01:51:51,833 --> 01:51:53,708
...three lamb chops,
two sunny-side ups.

1479
01:51:54,291 --> 01:51:56,666
-All this for you?
-Just keep them coming, brother.

1480
01:52:45,541 --> 01:52:46,583
Eat.

1481
01:52:55,291 --> 01:52:57,833
Wow! So you can smile.

1482
01:53:01,666 --> 01:53:02,541
Oh my!

1483
01:53:15,708 --> 01:53:16,541
Hey, buddy!

1484
01:53:17,458 --> 01:53:20,958
Your French kiss stayed
a dream till the end, huh?

1485
01:53:49,333 --> 01:53:50,166
Karthi!

1486
01:53:50,250 --> 01:53:51,083
Vadivu brother!

1487
01:53:51,250 --> 01:53:52,083
Careful...

1488
01:53:52,791 --> 01:53:54,166
Wait...
Wait...

1489
01:53:58,583 --> 01:54:00,250
The truck's wrecked.

1490
01:54:00,666 --> 01:54:02,000
You're badly hurt.

1491
01:54:02,666 --> 01:54:04,458
It'll take a month to recover.

1492
01:54:05,458 --> 01:54:06,375
Don't worry.

1493
01:54:06,791 --> 01:54:08,500
I'll look after you at the dhaba.

1494
01:54:10,041 --> 01:54:11,041
Who's that?

1495
01:54:12,625 --> 01:54:15,250
This lady was nearby
when your truck overturned.

1496
01:54:15,625 --> 01:54:16,875
She brought you here.

1497
01:54:17,291 --> 01:54:18,875
I offered money, but she refused.

1498
01:54:18,958 --> 01:54:21,000
She said she'd
wait till you woke up.

1499
01:54:21,750 --> 01:54:22,833
Hey! Call her!

1500
01:54:24,458 --> 01:54:25,291
Sister...

1501
01:54:26,875 --> 01:54:30,333
Why did you get
scared? Don't worry.

1502
01:54:30,708 --> 01:54:32,458
Everything will be alright!

1503
01:54:41,625 --> 01:54:42,458
Karthi...

1504
01:54:43,875 --> 01:54:45,166
What did you do to Subbu?

1505
01:54:47,875 --> 01:54:48,708
Did you kill him?

1506
01:55:03,208 --> 01:55:04,041
Hey!

1507
01:55:05,416 --> 01:55:07,750
They asked us to wait here.

1508
01:55:08,583 --> 01:55:10,500
I'll wait until
they pick you up.

1509
01:55:25,083 --> 01:55:26,583
Beautiful place, isn't it?

1510
01:56:18,250 --> 01:56:19,375
Buddy!

1511
01:56:20,791 --> 01:56:22,208
Why don't you try to...

1512
01:56:23,041 --> 01:56:27,708
enjoy the breeze,
the hills and the trees?

1513
01:56:29,208 --> 01:56:30,416
Feels meditative.

1514
01:57:15,416 --> 01:57:18,500
I promised your
father that I'd kill you.

1515
01:57:21,208 --> 01:57:23,125
That's why I brought
you in the truck.

1516
01:57:34,041 --> 01:57:37,291
Are you doing this out
of fear of my family or…

1517
01:57:37,666 --> 01:57:38,541
…do you also feel-

1518
01:57:38,625 --> 01:57:41,625
I too felt like killing you!

1519
01:57:44,583 --> 01:57:45,416
I still do.

1520
01:57:46,666 --> 01:57:48,500
I even tried a few times...

1521
01:57:48,625 --> 01:57:50,083
...but I couldn't.

1522
01:57:50,958 --> 01:57:52,083
Something is stopping me.

1523
01:57:53,125 --> 01:57:55,625
But today... right
now... I have to do it!

1524
01:57:55,708 --> 01:57:56,916
I don't have a choice!

1525
01:58:00,875 --> 01:58:02,000
Damn!

1526
01:58:04,458 --> 01:58:05,833
What a mess!

1527
01:58:10,750 --> 01:58:13,541
Maybe it's this
place or this breeze.

1528
01:58:15,250 --> 01:58:18,083
Felt like telling you
everything before killing you.

1529
01:58:20,583 --> 01:58:22,458
That’s it. I’ve told everything.

1530
01:58:23,625 --> 01:58:25,916
If you have any
last words, say them.

1531
01:58:28,083 --> 01:58:29,583
I'm all ears.

1532
01:58:44,166 --> 01:58:47,000
You were the first person
I wanted to tell, buddy.

1533
01:58:49,583 --> 01:58:50,916
When I was about to...

1534
01:58:52,833 --> 01:58:53,833
Karthi...

1535
01:58:55,416 --> 01:58:57,041
I need to tell you something.

1536
01:58:59,250 --> 01:59:01,041
Why are you
blushing like a eunuch?

1537
01:59:08,416 --> 01:59:12,833
If I cried, you'd call
me a girl... a ladyboy.

1538
01:59:20,666 --> 01:59:22,916
You were all I had, buddy.

1539
01:59:26,750 --> 01:59:30,708
I was scared you'd abandon
me if I told you, so I didn't.

1540
01:59:32,375 --> 01:59:33,375
You know what?

1541
01:59:39,375 --> 01:59:41,250
I didn't want to lose you…

1542
01:59:41,958 --> 01:59:43,750
…so I did the whole
beard, moustache...

1543
01:59:43,833 --> 01:59:46,041
...fights and swagger act.

1544
01:59:47,666 --> 01:59:49,708
I pretended to be
a man, just for you.

1545
02:00:09,791 --> 02:00:13,125
You men cling to male
pride, caste and other crap…

1546
02:00:13,208 --> 02:00:15,833
...rotting in hate and
killing each other.

1547
02:00:16,625 --> 02:00:19,250
But God created us
to show you all that…

1548
02:00:19,500 --> 02:00:21,708
...none of it is permanent.

1549
02:00:26,375 --> 02:00:29,000
We're the test of
your humanity...

1550
02:00:29,541 --> 02:00:31,833
...but all of you have failed.

1551
02:00:38,375 --> 02:00:41,750
Our society and
upbringing are the reason.

1552
02:00:42,625 --> 02:00:45,583
It'll take centuries
for you all to pass.

1553
02:00:50,916 --> 02:00:54,291
A question from our eighth
grade Social Science book.

1554
02:00:54,750 --> 02:00:57,416
What's the one ideology everyone
upholds across countries,

1555
02:00:57,500 --> 02:01:00,291
language, religion and race?

1556
02:01:01,541 --> 02:01:02,375
Take a guess.

1557
02:01:05,750 --> 02:01:08,000
Gender discrimination,
you bastards!

1558
02:01:27,375 --> 02:01:30,250
I've said everything
I had to say.

1559
02:01:30,333 --> 02:01:33,458
I've laughed till
my eyes ran dry.

1560
02:01:33,666 --> 02:01:37,291
I've eaten parottas to
my heart's content too.

1561
02:01:48,833 --> 02:01:50,041
Go ahead, buddy.

1562
02:01:52,833 --> 02:01:53,916
Kill me.

1563
02:01:57,500 --> 02:01:58,583
Move on.

1564
02:02:00,208 --> 02:02:01,500
Live a happy life.

1565
02:03:31,500 --> 02:03:33,958
Dorothy's photo…

1566
02:03:36,041 --> 02:03:36,875
Here.

1567
02:03:38,000 --> 02:03:39,500
The money's from your dad.

1568
02:03:39,833 --> 02:03:41,041
This is all that's left.

1569
02:03:41,500 --> 02:03:43,166
The bangles are
from Dhanalakshmi.

1570
02:03:43,291 --> 02:03:47,041
Please save Subbu somehow.

1571
02:04:07,083 --> 02:04:08,916
The locket on your neck...

1572
02:04:09,416 --> 02:04:11,458
...and your amulet...

1573
02:04:11,541 --> 02:04:13,291
...give them to me.

1574
02:04:13,875 --> 02:04:15,083
Don't ask why.

1575
02:04:25,166 --> 02:04:27,916
Don't ever come
back to the village.

1576
02:04:28,375 --> 02:04:30,208
My head will roll.

1577
02:04:31,333 --> 02:04:33,541
I'll tell them I killed you.

1578
02:04:36,166 --> 02:04:38,083
That's true, in a way.

1579
02:04:39,291 --> 02:04:42,000
My friend Subbu died
long back, didn't he?

1580
02:04:43,291 --> 02:04:45,250
Wherever you go, be happy.

1581
02:04:48,500 --> 02:04:49,541
Bye...

1582
02:04:52,875 --> 02:04:53,708
Bye, girl.

1583
02:05:22,916 --> 02:05:29,916
♪ The golden gem I hold in my hand, ♪

1584
02:05:30,208 --> 02:05:37,166
♪ Do I claim it, or do I let it go? ♪

1585
02:05:37,333 --> 02:05:44,250
♪ The golden gem I hold in my hand... ♪

1586
02:06:20,541 --> 02:06:27,458
♪ The golden gem I hold in my hand, ♪

1587
02:06:27,916 --> 02:06:34,708
♪ Do I claim it, or do I let it go? ♪

1588
02:06:35,000 --> 02:06:41,833
♪ The path we walked
together has split in two. ♪

1589
02:06:42,208 --> 02:06:49,166
♪ The bond that brought
us here has snapped. ♪

1590
02:06:49,333 --> 02:06:56,291
♪ Who is to blame?
What is left to say? ♪

1591
02:06:56,666 --> 02:07:03,666
♪ Who is to blame?
What is left to say? ♪

1592
02:07:12,125 --> 02:07:14,333
Subbu died, didn't he, brother?

1593
02:07:16,583 --> 02:07:18,583
When he knew I took
him along just to kill him...

1594
02:07:18,666 --> 02:07:20,166
...he'd have died right there.

1595
02:07:24,708 --> 02:07:26,083
Subbu is dead.

1596
02:07:28,625 --> 02:07:29,875
I killed him.

1597
02:07:31,833 --> 02:07:34,166
How did you convince
those morons...

1598
02:07:34,250 --> 02:07:36,291
...that the beggar was Subbu?

1599
02:07:36,541 --> 02:07:39,125
Didn't we give you a gun?

1600
02:07:39,208 --> 02:07:41,916
Why did you smash his face
instead of shooting him?

1601
02:07:42,583 --> 02:07:43,750
He fought back.

1602
02:07:43,833 --> 02:07:45,750
He grabbed my gun
and tried to shoot me.

1603
02:07:46,291 --> 02:07:48,416
I had no choice. I
killed him with a rock.

1604
02:07:48,500 --> 02:07:49,791
He used to be healthy.

1605
02:07:49,875 --> 02:07:52,583
His face and body look
so different now.

1606
02:07:52,791 --> 02:07:53,916
Brother...

1607
02:07:54,000 --> 02:07:55,875
They say when people
even start thinking like that...

1608
02:07:55,958 --> 02:07:57,791
... their bodies start
mutating instantly.

1609
02:07:58,916 --> 02:08:00,166
What a mess!

1610
02:08:04,000 --> 02:08:05,708
They're morons, brother.

1611
02:08:05,791 --> 02:08:07,625
It was a piece of cake.

1612
02:08:14,666 --> 02:08:18,750
♪ Like a blossoming flower, ♪

1613
02:08:18,833 --> 02:08:23,375
♪ You’re a growing beautiful vision ♪

1614
02:08:23,708 --> 02:08:29,041
♪ Like the twilight before the dawn,
You’re a graceful swan in bloom ♪

1615
02:08:29,125 --> 02:08:36,083
♪ You’re the soft, tender breeze playing
in the river, caressing the vines ♪

1616
02:09:10,125 --> 02:09:11,375
Where's Karthi?

1617
02:09:14,166 --> 02:09:15,291
Karthi!

1618
02:09:20,041 --> 02:09:21,250
Yeah, brother?

1619
02:09:22,958 --> 02:09:25,291
You've been acting
strange for the past month.

1620
02:09:25,375 --> 02:09:29,833
Always sitting on
that rock, looking lost.

1621
02:09:33,333 --> 02:09:34,416
Oh, that?

1622
02:09:36,166 --> 02:09:38,416
Tomorrow's the
December festival.

1623
02:09:40,125 --> 02:09:42,500
By now, he must've
become a woman.

1624
02:09:45,041 --> 02:09:45,875
Tch!

1625
02:09:46,583 --> 02:09:47,750
She, I mean.

1626
02:09:48,416 --> 02:09:49,500
That's good, isn't it?

1627
02:09:50,125 --> 02:09:52,000
Why do you look so empty?

1628
02:09:52,166 --> 02:09:53,083
I don't know, brother.

1629
02:09:54,583 --> 02:09:56,416
Something's gnawing at my heart.

1630
02:09:58,541 --> 02:10:00,875
Her face keeps flashing before me.

1631
02:10:00,958 --> 02:10:02,541
It's killing me.

1632
02:10:04,250 --> 02:10:07,916
When I saw her for the
last time, in a churidhar...

1633
02:10:08,541 --> 02:10:11,791
... it hit me how much
I made her suffer.

1634
02:10:15,000 --> 02:10:16,500
Subbu's a girl.

1635
02:10:18,125 --> 02:10:19,708
Her walk...

1636
02:10:20,291 --> 02:10:21,875
Her smile...

1637
02:10:25,791 --> 02:10:29,000
She even blushed when
handing me her amulet!

1638
02:10:29,666 --> 02:10:32,125
She's a girl. She's
definitely a girl.

1639
02:10:33,750 --> 02:10:36,541
All she ever wanted was the
arrogance of being a woman.

1640
02:10:36,625 --> 02:10:37,583
Acceptance!

1641
02:10:37,666 --> 02:10:39,750
You’re right. I
meant acceptance.

1642
02:10:41,875 --> 02:10:45,500
If we can't even give her
that, what kind of men are we?

1643
02:10:46,750 --> 02:10:49,375
We’re all
gender-discriminating bastards!

1644
02:10:50,208 --> 02:10:51,166
Right?

1645
02:10:52,041 --> 02:10:52,875
Go on.

1646
02:10:53,000 --> 02:10:54,625
What can I say?

1647
02:10:56,083 --> 02:10:58,625
I haven't eaten or
slept properly in days.

1648
02:10:59,708 --> 02:11:02,833
I used to feel disgusted
just looking at her.

1649
02:11:04,125 --> 02:11:06,833
But the day before
I dropped her off...

1650
02:11:07,500 --> 02:11:09,333
...something changed.

1651
02:11:11,833 --> 02:11:15,875
The disgust vanished.

1652
02:11:17,666 --> 02:11:19,041
After dropping her...

1653
02:11:21,166 --> 02:11:22,625
... my heart felt heavy.

1654
02:11:24,541 --> 02:11:25,541
It still feels that way.

1655
02:11:28,625 --> 02:11:31,000
She kept watching me go.

1656
02:11:34,041 --> 02:11:35,958
It's burned into my head like a photo.

1657
02:11:38,916 --> 02:11:39,916
I have never felt like this before.

1658
02:11:43,125 --> 02:11:45,791
It didn't hurt so bad even
when Thangamalar got married.

1659
02:11:47,833 --> 02:11:48,875
I don't know what's going on.

1660
02:11:51,125 --> 02:11:52,625
You've in love, kid.

1661
02:11:52,708 --> 02:11:53,541
Tch!

1662
02:11:53,875 --> 02:11:55,541
What rubbish!

1663
02:11:56,416 --> 02:11:58,333
Love? Him?

1664
02:11:58,500 --> 02:11:59,541
Get lost!

1665
02:11:59,625 --> 02:12:01,083
Stop talking crap!

1666
02:12:02,666 --> 02:12:03,750
"Him"?

1667
02:12:06,166 --> 02:12:08,250
All this while, you
called her a girl.

1668
02:12:08,333 --> 02:12:10,875
Now when I say it's
love, you say "him"?

1669
02:12:11,541 --> 02:12:15,541
Like you said, Subbu the man died
long ago. The one you dropped was…

1670
02:12:15,625 --> 02:12:21,666
…a girl who pretended to be a man
only because she was afraid to lose you.

1671
02:12:22,666 --> 02:12:24,333
Shut up, brother!

1672
02:12:24,625 --> 02:12:27,625
Listen, kid. Your heart says
yes, but your mind says no.

1673
02:12:27,875 --> 02:12:30,125
The heart is god, and
the mind is the devil.

1674
02:12:31,041 --> 02:12:32,708
Listen to what god says, Karthi.

1675
02:12:37,291 --> 02:12:42,416
Long, gruelling journeys
end with love.

1676
02:13:01,333 --> 02:13:04,916
Yes, brother.
I am in love with her.

1677
02:13:16,833 --> 02:13:17,791
Brother...

1678
02:13:20,750 --> 02:13:22,125
Isn't this wrong?

1679
02:13:24,000 --> 02:13:26,166
What will the world say?

1680
02:13:26,416 --> 02:13:28,208
Forget the world.

1681
02:13:28,708 --> 02:13:31,333
Listen only to your heart.

1682
02:13:31,625 --> 02:13:35,541
-But her family...
-Go on, kid. Go live happily with her.

1683
02:13:35,625 --> 02:13:39,166
Let her family and the whole
world die, clinging to their pride!

1684
02:15:00,083 --> 02:15:02,250
Just as the water
meets the sky...

1685
02:15:02,333 --> 02:15:04,000
...let both your hands meet too.

1686
02:15:26,041 --> 02:15:28,333
May the goddess bless you!

1687
02:15:33,000 --> 02:15:34,416
Subbu!

