♪ Come, my darling! ♪

1735
02:18:27,666 --> 02:18:32,958
♪ Be my companion, sweetheart! ♪

1736
02:18:34,708 --> 02:18:41,583
Let the skies, earth, elders
and children hear this!

1737
02:18:41,666 --> 02:18:48,125
Let the dogs, foxes, grass,
shrubs and every insect hear this.

1738
02:18:48,208 --> 02:18:51,625
From today, do you wish to
be Bahuchara Mata's daughter?

1739
02:18:53,041 --> 02:18:57,166
To every soul with a mother's
heart, she'll be a daughter.

1740
02:18:59,583 --> 02:19:02,000
From this day, her name is…

1741
02:19:02,083 --> 02:19:05,083
Dorothy! Dorothy! Dorothy!

1742
